  "scope": "Independently consented BodyRef targets matched to the selected same-photo measured face reference, using the unchanged native full-source brightness/chroma solver, actual complete mixed-image review, canonical graph/support/history/export and neutral clear. Old face-only recipes unchanged; no new algorithm count.",
