    "independent_review": "Engine audit corrected dedicated body-support dispatch and capture overlap accounting; owner face-skin dependency and overly broad ROI accounting corrected. Native confirmation captures retained preview and both image receipts in existing receipt owner. Static review only, not correctness or performance acceptance.",
