  "remaining": [
    "Automatic brightest measured-reference proposal helper/host/UI is separate, unhooked and excluded from this snapshot. Automatic person-instance segmentation and complete proprietary AI feature equivalence remain unimplemented.",
    "Manual current-photo body ownership and visible/unoccluded skin consent are required; merged semantic evidence alone does not prove person ownership. Selected reference face and every retained face region are protected from this body operation, not from unrelated portrait edits.",
    "Preset/batch/cohort/shared-source alias activation remains guarded; no donor reference/support/mask/fit copied. Dedicated effect-recovery painting remains separate.",
    "All runtime/numerical/ABI/GUI/history/reopen/export/real-photo/performance acceptance UNRUN; no 24MP or preview/export pixel-parity claim. Source/review display is reduced RGB8, not native-resolution inspection.",
    "Original opaque SDR PNG16/ICC16/RAW16 and canonical derived float source contracts retained; unsupported alpha/HDR is refused without clipping. Existing full-render and memory caps apply, no final-resolution downsampling fallback.",
    "Stale body evidence preserves nonzero historical intent but blocks rendering until explicitly cleared or re-reviewed; it is not silently rebound. Unknown mutation keeps original-request query/fence; no new verified workspace-retirement protocol. Full application restart and last confirmed saved-project reopen may be required and can lose unsaved edits.",
    "One reviewed body is changed per submission while all retained targets are validated. The common donor remains conservative across active face/body lanes. Source-capture/decoder/solver cancellation and large-image working-set guarantees remain limited."
  ],
